cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Cite this software with its exact commit and experiment version. V3 is an ongoing benchmark; legacy results are subject to the published audit."
title: "CalligraGuard / CFDefect"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Alqithami
    given-names: Saad
repository-code: "https://github.com/alqithami/calligraguard"
url: "https://github.com/alqithami/calligraguard"
abstract: >-
  Versioned research software for synthetic glyph-outline interventions,
  reference-aware multi-task inspection, normal-only anomaly baselines,
  observation-level data validation, and false-alarm evaluation. The repository
  preserves audited legacy artifacts and the frozen source of the ongoing v3 study.
keywords:
  - glyph inspection
  - Arabic typography
  - anomaly detection
  - benchmark
  - reproducibility
license: "MIT"
